<https://brickschema.org/schema/Brick#Power> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Power is the rate at which work is performed or energy is transmitted, or the amount of energy required or expended for a given unit of time. As a rate of change of work done or the energy of a subsystem, power is: (P = W/t), where (P) is power, (W) is work and {t} is time."@en ;
